// Sandy Cove: a beach at low tide. The beacon stands halfway along a sandbar, a yard one tile
// wide and five long, so whoever holds it can be come at from either side. Sea-worn rocks stand
// either side of the bar between the starts, rather than in front of them, and the bar's two
// ends run out into the rocks.
id: cove
name: Sandy Cove
